# Job Application Tracker — PA

> Managed by **PA**. Last updated: 2026-08-13.
> This is the single source of truth for Adam's job search. It is updated by:
> - `PA Daily Job Discovery` (8 AM ET) — logs new matches and prepares apply-ready packages for roles >= 80% fit.
> - `PA Daily Follow-Up Check` (10 AM ET) — drafts follow-ups for `Applied` roles whose follow-up date is due.
> - `PA Weekly ClearanceJobs Hunter Batch` (Mondays 7 AM ET) — evaluates up to 20 ClearanceJobs listings.
> Apply-ready packages are saved to `memory/apply_ready/YYYY-MM-DD_<company>_<role>.md`.

