## Status Legend

- **New** — Identified but not yet reviewed.
- **Reviewed** — JD compared to Adam’s profile; awaiting decision.
- **Drafting** — Resume/cover letter in progress.
- **Applied** — Submitted, awaiting response.
- **Phone Screen** — Recruiter/HR call scheduled/completed.
- **Interview** — Technical or panel interview scheduled/completed.
- **Offer** — Offer received.
- **Rejected** — Closed.
- **Withdrawn** — Adam withdrew.

